Z||000000||MontanaFiero||09-29-2001||02:13 AM||||My head lights won't go up. I can manually crank them up as long as they are on, but when I turn them off, they just go back down again.  I took the connector off of the back of the light switch and jumped between the wires, but I could not make them go up. What's going on?  If anyone could tell me what color wire at the relay does what, then I could troubleshoot (Chilton's diagrams suck)<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg"> ||||reg||5
